  "worked_solution": "Using the logical inference rule of *denying the consequent* (also known as modus tollens), we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u00acZ \\\\ (X\u2228Y)\u21d2Z \\\\ \u2234\u00ac(X\u2228Y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the logical inference rule of *implication elimination* (also known as *modus ponens*) with the conclusion from the previous step, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u00ac(X\u2228Y) \\\\ \u00ac(X\u2228Y)\u21d2\u00acW \\\\ \u2234\u00acW\\end{aligned}\n$$",
